WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:11.020
Hey guys, Pete here. we're coming up on
the end of the Game of Thrones series on

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:17.410
HBO and I find myself to be caught up in
all the excitement

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.070
