00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:49.990
fundamental things that need to happen
for a logical conclusion. as you know I'm

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:54.310
just a fan so these are just things that
I came up with while trying to sort out

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:58.780
all the different possibilities and
let's be honest there are a lot of possibilities

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.000
there's so many theories - 
both good and bad theories I like that I

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.360
think might happen and theories that I
like that I don't think there's any

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.860
chance that are gonna happen. naturally
I'm gonna touch on the thinking that led

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:17.650
