00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:22.900
Number 1: the series needs to come to an end it needs to end. obviously that will happen,

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.220
this is the final season so I'm not talking about it in that way. the showrunners were given

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:31.150
the broad strokes of how the book series
will end and the show has to reflect that.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:36.520
we don't need an answer for every
single question but there has to be an

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:42.040
actual ending, a definitive ending to the
series. I list this number one because

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:46.030
it's going to overlap several of the
other things and so we'll leave it at

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:51.220
